# Leader's Talent, level 1: "Whenever you attack, put a +1/+1 counter on target attacking creature." Bot1's Ornithopter
# attacks on turn 3 and gets the counter (power 1, toughness 3) when the trigger resolves; Bot1 keeps it. On turn 4 Bot2's own
# Ornithopter attacks: the Talent is Bot1's, so nothing triggers (Stack stays empty) and Bot1's Ornithopter has no more counters.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl x2
Leader's Talent
Ornithopter
Plains x3
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Leader's Talent.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 3
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot1)
? Stack.Count = 0

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
